            <div xml:id="d253">

                <pb facs="0610" n="572" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv11/pg572"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 184.1 Bullitt, William C.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. William C. Bullitt to the Secretary General of the
                        Commission to Negotiate Peace</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-05-17">May 17, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Joe</hi>: I append a copy of the letter of
                    resignation which I have just sent to the Secretary of State and a copy of a
                    note to the President. Personally, I regret extremely that I feel it necessary
                    to leave the service of the Government, but I cannot convince myself that any
                    good will ever come from the imposition on the world of the proposed peace and,
                    therefore, I cannot conscientiously labor for its establishment.</p>
                <pb facs="0611" n="573" xml:id="pg573"/>
                <p>Before I go, I wish to express to you the feelings of respect and friendship
                    which I hold for you personally. I feel that I owe to you the experiences of the
                    past year and a half and I shall never forget your unfailing courtesy and
                    kindness to me. I hope that it may not be long before we are again working
                    together for the establishment of a real peace.</p>
                <p>With my sincerest thanks and all good wishes, I am</p>
                <p>Very respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William C.
                    Bullitt</hi></signed></closer>



